      "mergedPostDetails": "Since the Physics.set gravity node exists now, it would also be nice to fine tune the physics minimum velocity for bounce calculation setting.  This would allow small objects moving at proportionally small speeds to be able to bounce instead of falling flat on an elastic surface like they do with the default seting. (billiards, pong) https://docs.unity3d.com/2018.4/Documentation/ScriptReference/Physics-bounceThreshold.html",
